/// \defgroup grp_audio Audio
/// \brief Sound events, the Miles audio backend and large-group audio.
///
/// `AudioManager` (`TheAudio`) and its Miles Sound System implementation,
/// `MilesAudioManager`; the event classes `AudioEventInfo` and
/// `AudioEventRTS`; the sound file cache; and the logic-side
/// `LargeGroupAudio` subsystem with its `LargeGroupAudioUpdate` module.
/// \ref sub_audio describes the subsystem, its INI data and its
/// differences from Zero Hour, with notes for modders and remasters.
